  "description": "Social Phobia Inventory (Connor et al., 2000). Total = sum of the 17 items (each 0-4), range 0-68. Severity: 0-20 none/minimal, 21-30 mild, 31-40 moderate, 41-50 severe, 51-68 very severe (a total of 19 or more suggests social anxiety disorder).",
